+# Phase 9C-B State-Transition Protocol Implementation
+
+## 0. Metadata
+
+- Phase：`Phase 9C-B`
+- Date：`2026-07-28`
+- Direct control commit：`966cfa4072c63fd8abc05870a57f0dd8f6a1ab8a`
+- Branch：`codex/evaluation-harness`
+- Direct control profile：`kama-coding-mvp-v1-deepseek-v4-pro-requirement-contract-v1`
+- Treatment profile：`kama-coding-mvp-v1-deepseek-v4-pro-requirement-contract-v2`
+- Scope：严格单变量追加 generic state-transition/failure-injection protocol，冻结本地实验身份与预注册。
+- Out of scope：真实模型/API、benchmark、holdout、任务/grader/suite、Evaluation/Benchmark runtime、timeout 或 Agent lifecycle 修改。
+- External report：等待 External Diff Review。
+
+## 1. Problem and direct control
+
+Phase 9B 的 requirement-contract protocol 提升了总体表现，但 inventory lifecycle 仍为 0/3。失败集中在多操作状态变更中：Agent 可能验证 happy path，却没有明确枚举早期 mutation、后续 failure point 和失败后的 invariant。
+
+Direct control 必须是 Phase 9B，而不是其他 baseline：
+
+| Metric | Phase 9B |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Overall | 20/27 |
+| Bug fixing | 9/9 |
+| Feature implementation | 5/9 |
+| Test generation | 6/9 |
+| Inventory lifecycle | 0/3 |
+| Atomic + inventory | 2/6 |
+| Timeout | 3/27 |
+| Complete median latency | 80056.252 ms |
+| Complete median input + output tokens | 10887.5 |
+| Total wall | 2413.770 s |
+| Runtime/infra/trace/grader failures | 0 |
+| Status | VALID |
+
+Phase 9C-B only changes the default prompt. No runtime branch decides whether a task is stateful。
+
+## 2. Why it matters to an Agent
+
+The protocol adds an auditable planning checkpoint to the existing plan → act → observe loop：
+
+```text
+goal
+  → identify persistent/shared pre-state
+  → enumerate ordered mutations
+  → identify later failure points
+  → state success/failure post-state
+  → execute
+  → inject one failure after an earlier mutation
+  → verify rollback/compensation invariant
+```
+
+This is guidance, not a runtime gate. `AgentLoop` does not parse the goal、store a checklist、force a tool or alter stopping。
+
+## 3. Architecture and module boundaries
+
+| Module | Role | Must not own |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `src/kama_claude/core/loop.py` | Unique default prompt source; exact v2 append | Task classification、protocol state、new events |
+| `ExecutionContext.system_prompt()` | Existing base/override and context-layer composition | v2 text ownership |
+| `AgentRunner` | Existing runtime assembly | Experiment-specific prompt behavior |
+| `TracingProvider` | Existing local observation of actual API-call identity | Applying profile behavior |
+| Benchmark identity observer | Hash actual trace system bytes and ordered tools | Prompt mutation |
+| Experiment profile | Declare expected identity | Carry raw prompt text or override runtime |
+
+Data flow：
+
+```text
+AgentLoop frozen default bytes
+  → ExecutionContext chooses default or override
+  → Global Context
+  → Project Context
+  → Session Notes
+  → TracingProvider records actual system bytes privately
+  → observer hashes UTF-8 bytes
+  → declared/observed identity comparison
+```
+
+## 4. Exact prompt identities
